@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Nanum Gothic
skinparam shadowing false
title 환자 코드 소비 상태 확인과 화면 수명
actor Patient
actor Caregiver
boundary "Patient code dialog" as UI
control "Flutter LinkPatientCaregiver" as Client
boundary "Authenticated Medication API" as API
control "Backend LinkPatientCaregiver" as Control
database "Link code + active link" as DB

Patient -> UI: Open generated code
UI -> UI: Bound watch to code expiry, at most 15 minutes
par Patient foreground polling
loop Current foreground dialog, same account, unexpired code; one request at a time
UI -> Client: requestPatientCodeStatus(code, abortTrigger)
Client -> API: GET /link/code/status; 15s client timeout
API -> API: Resolve authenticated owner
API -> Control: requestPatientCodeStatus(owner, exactCode)
Control -> DB: One owner-scoped snapshot of code and its consumer's active pair
DB --> Control: Code consumption, expiry and current relationship
Control --> API: pending / linked / expired / revoked (404 if absent)
API --> Client: Cache-Control: no-store
Client --> UI: Verify response code and patient identity
alt Matching linked result and still-current dialog
UI -> UI: Stop watch; show success and notify parent link refresh
else Expired or revoked
UI -> UI: Stop watch; allow regeneration
else Pending or transient/auth/network error
UI -> UI: No success inference; wait 2s after request completes
end
end
note over UI,Client: Closing, backgrounding or account change aborts/invalidate requests.\nLate results cannot complete another dialog; resume rechecks without overlap.

else Caregiver code registration
Caregiver -> API: Register displayed patient code
API -> Control: Existing single-use code registration
Control -> DB: Consume exact code; create/reactivate active pair
end
note over Patient,Caregiver: Registration and polling are independent requests.\nA generic link-list change does not prove this code was consumed.

Patient -> API: Unlink caregiver
API -> Control: Existing authorized unlink
Control -> DB: Unlink pair; mark unused codes used and clear this pair's code consumption proof
note over Control,DB: A later re-link does not resurrect success for an older revoked code.\nOther active pairs' consumed codes are preserved.
@enduml
